{"version":1,"id":"troye-sivan-youth","title":"Youth","artist":"Troye Sivan","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/troye-sivan/youth/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Mc Laughlin Brett Leland, Alex Hope, Bram Inscore, Allie X and Troye Sivan","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"What if, what if we run away? What if, what if we left today?","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"What if we say goodbye to safe and sound?","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"And what if, what if we're hard to find? What if, what if we lost our mind?","columns":75,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"What if we let them fall behind and they're never found","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"And when the lights start flashing like a photobooth","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"And the stars exploding, we'll be fireproof","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","t